  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det svenska st&#xF6;det till NTIHC syftar till att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra h&#xE4;lsan hos unga kvinnor och m&#xE4;n. Det svenska st&#xF6;det ges till att genomf&#xF6;ra NTIHC strategiska plan 2007/08-2010/11 med fokus p&#xE5; att utveckla NTIHC till en f&#xF6;rebild f&#xF6;r h&#xE4;lsoservice till ungdomar, st&#xE4;rka partnerskap och f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrat deltagande p&#xE5; lokal niv&#xE5;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish support to NTIHC is an example of the SRH programs to promote the health and well being of young women and men. This support to the strategic plan 2007/8-2010/11 with the strategic objectives of establishing NTIHC as a centre of excellence in delivery of ASRH services, promote acess to quslity services and information on ASRH and rights, to strenghthen partnerships, community involvment &amp;susta</narrative>
  </description>
